# userland bring-up of pdx203 (stage 7 start): the stage 6 kernel (pdx203-full_defconfig) plus the SystemOS
# owner-cache union, so launchd's dyld finds the shared cache. measured on the phone 2026-11-01 with the
# stage 6 kernel: the OS volume mounts as root and launchd execs, then initproc dies with "Library not loaded:
# /usr/lib/libSystem.B.dylib ... (no such file, no dyld cache)". on 21H461 the cache (System/Library/Caches/
# com.apple.dyld) is only on Cryptex1,SystemOS, never on the OS volume.
#
# the uke route (UniXNU-uke uke-userland_defconfig), not the signed owner-root one: BRINGUP_OWNER_CACHE lets
# the cache mount build without OWNER_ROOT_TRUST, drivers/NativeUfs supplies the two authorization helpers
# kern_exec.c calls (only under native-ufs-allow-unverified=1) and the unixnu fork carries uke's root auth
# bypass patch. OWNER_CACHE_MOUNT mounts the SystemOS volume (8846FE78-2910-4297-AF97-D59BB6F8FC16) read-only,
# UNION_SYSTEMOS puts it over / as a native union, CACHE_STARTUP sets dyld's no-ignition flag.
#
# Data: with the cache union launchd ran its boot tasks and panicked "mount[3] exited ... exit status 66" (no Data
# volume for /private/var). OWNER_DATA_MOUNT mounts the payload's Data seed writable at /private/var through the
# NativeRamBlock IOMedia (alioth measured that APFS refuses the bare /dev/md0). the seed is the original
# private/var of the OS image (scripts/prepare-owner-data-fixture.py, 39 files, packed with DarwinBoot's
# packed_ramdisk.py), passed with --data-ramdisk, and OWNER_DATA_VOLUME_UUID is that seed's volume uuid. it lives in
# ram, nothing is written back to the phone.
#
# display: with Data, SpringBoard launched and crashed in a loop, there was no framebuffer service.
# NATIVE_LEGACY_DISPLAY links the GOP display (scripts/build-pdx203-legacy-display.py): NativeLegacyDisplay, the owned
# backend of the unchanged IOMobileFramebufferLegacy, on the framebuffer darwinboot hands over, started by the board probe
# once IOSurface is up (offline-legacy-* in board.toml, sheng's set of 2026-10-22).
CONFIG_XNU_BUILD_ARCHIVES=y
CONFIG_XNU_BRINGUP_OWNER_CACHE=y
CONFIG_XNU_SOURCE_CORECRYPTO14=y
CONFIG_XNU_SOURCE_PTHREAD=y
CONFIG_XNU_ARM_DT_PLATFORM=y
CONFIG_XNU_ARMCPU=y
CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_UFS=y
CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_AES=y
CONFIG_XNU_TRUST_CACHE_RUNTIME=y
CONFIG_XNU_SOURCE_MOCKFS=y
CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_CS_HASH_CACHE=y
CONFIG_XNU_SHENG_PMGR=y
CONFIG_XNU_DT_PANIC_REGION=y
CONFIG_XNU_ZONE_PGZ_ALIGNMENT_PROBE=y
CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_ARCH_TIMER=y
CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_PAN=y
CONFIG_XNU_CRYPTO_BOOTSTRAP="prelinked"
CONFIG_XNU_EXTRA_LD_ARCHIVES="{tree}/build/pdx203-stubs/libPdx203Stubs.a"

CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_LEGACY_DISPLAY=y
# CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_VIRTIO_BLOCK is not set
CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_RAM_BLOCK=y
# CONFIG_XNU_VERIFIED_ROOT_PROBE is not set
# CONFIG_XNU_OWNER_ROOT_AUDIT is not set
# CONFIG_XNU_OWNER_ROOT_TRUST is not set
CONFIG_XNU_OWNER_CACHE_MOUNT=y
CONFIG_XNU_OWNER_CACHE_STARTUP=y
# CONFIG_XNU_OWNER_BOOT_MANIFEST is not set
CONFIG_XNU_OWNER_DATA_MOUNT=y
CONFIG_XNU_OWNER_DATA_VOLUME_UUID="098C9EBC-6911-4BEA-94C8-1775B4B33D87"
CONFIG_XNU_OWNER_UNION_SYSTEMOS=y
# CONFIG_XNU_BOOT_PROGRESS is not set
# CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_ADRENO is not set
CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_MOBILE_DISPLAY=n
CONFIG_XNU_ARMVIRT_PLATFORM=n
